# Loadable modules placed in /usr/lib/modules/<kver> (plus their dependencies,
# resolved from modules.dep). Keep this SHORT: udev cold-plugs whatever it can
# match, and on this phone the wrong module hard-resets the SoC (qcom_wdt,
# remoteprocs). Wi-Fi is blacklisted from cold-plug and loaded in order by
# r8q-wifi.service.
phy-qcom-qmp-pcie
pwrseq-qcom-wcn
pci-pwrctrl-pwrseq
qrtr-mhi
ath11k_pci
